+## Tokens (css/studio.css `:root`) - Dusk violet
+The last minutes of dusk: deep plum to midnight violet, with Nicofoxheart's heart colours (sakura pink and fox-fire
+orange) as the only warm lights. What you touch is soft violet clay; what shows the sound sits behind darker night glass.
+- Surfaces: `--room #120C1F` (body: plum-to-midnight gradient with a faint sakura glow top-left and fox-fire bottom-right),
+  `--chassis #1D152E`, `--panel #221936`, `--panel-hi #2B2142`, `--well #170F26`, lanes `--lane #1D1530`/`--lane-alt #19122A`.
+- Ink: `--ink #F5EDF7`, `--ink-2 #D6C8E2`, `--ink-3 #ADA0C2` (6:1+ on panels), `--ink-4 #8F81AA` (small labels only).
+- Glass: `--glass #0D0818`, `--glass-ink #F8EFF6`, `--glass-dim #AB9BC0`.
+- Keycaps: `--key-bg` violet clay, `--key-on` lit lilac (selected tab, play, pressed options; white text 5:1+),
+  `--key-signal` fox fire with `--on-signal` dark ink (7:1). Focus ring `--focus` = 2px room + 2px `--sakura`.
+- Signal colours: `--signal #FF7A45` fox fire (play head, record, export, peak), `--cobalt #A190FF` dusk lilac (Space),
+  `--saffron #FFC163` lantern amber (loop, Echo, cloud glow), `--leaf #62D6A4` firefly mint (on/saved), `--sakura #FF8FC7`.
+  Meters run lilac -> sakura -> fox fire.
+- Track colours: 8 dusk inks in `sample-project.js` `TRACK_COLORS` (fox fire, amber, moss, aqua, periwinkle, lilac,
+  sakura, mist; 7:1+ on the lanes, dark `--on-c` text on clip strips). Saved tapes with the old light-theme inks are
+  mapped by `duskColor()` when a project opens; each track's colour runs through its head chip, clips, notes,
   meter, mixer strip and keyboard.
 - Type: Archivo (wide-ish grotesk, 600-800 for names, uppercase tracked 10px labels) + IBM Plex Mono for every number.
   Fallbacks: Helvetica Neue / Arial and ui-monospace (Google Fonts are blocked in this container, so screenshots use fallbacks).
